1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,700
Welcome! Here's how the league works, from sign-up to earning points.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,700
Step one: enter your first name and last initial.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,700
Step two: enter your email. No password: we email you a link.

4
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:20,700
Step three: tick the privacy box. Only facilitators can see your email.

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:25,700
Step four: choose learner or volunteer.

6
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:31,700
Step five: pick the team you'd like to join, then tap Complete Registration.

7
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:37,700
Finally, open the link we email you. A facilitator approves you, then you can start.

8
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:48,700
Every weekday, a short challenge appears: about five to fifteen minutes. Answer by typing, a voice note, or a photo.

9
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:54,700
Your facilitator reviews your effort and awards points for your team.

10
00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:03,700
Claim ten bonus points each week by attending in person at the Connect Talent centre. Your facilitator confirms it.

11
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:11,700
Check the leaderboard any time to see your team's rank and individual scores.

12
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,700
That's the whole workflow. Have fun, and enjoy learning!
